## Output format

Return ONLY a single valid JSON object with no surrounding prose and no code fences. Use this exact shape:

```
{
  "title": "string",
  "description": "string",
  "slug": "{{suggestedSlug}}",
  "category": "{{category}}",
  "tags": ["string"],
  "content": "Full Markdown body with ## sections",
  "faq": [
    { "question": "string", "answer": "string" }
  ],
  "keyTakeaways": ["string"]
}
```

Rules for the JSON:

- `slug` must be exactly `{{suggestedSlug}}`.
- `category` must be exactly `{{category}}`.
- `content` excludes the title and excludes the FAQ section — the FAQ is rendered from the `faq` array.
- `keyTakeaways` contains 3–5 single-sentence summary points.
- Escape all newlines inside `content` as `\n` so the JSON parses cleanly.
